[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p>1. Undo retaining bolts</p><p>2. Release the running borad from the fastening clips and remove\nit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047218.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the running board (1a) in position fitting the pin (1b)\nin the special opening (1c) and the tabs (1d) in the special clips\n(1e).</p><p>2. Tighten the retaining bolt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047219.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p>"]]